  "decision": "RETAIN_BOUNDED_FUSION_PROTOTYPE_NO_PRODUCTION_INTEGRATION",
  "limits": [
    "Actual pinned runtime noise with synthetic density/classification/callbacks, not complete Forge chunk generation",
    "Identical exact raw floating comparisons on this Java8/Windows host only",
    "Explicit transfer bytes derived from executed JNI region lengths;hidden copies and allocations/RSS unmeasured",
    "Observed callback fence/throw/RNG parity limited to specified synthetic callbacks;actual Forge callback closure absent",
    "Five shared-host forks;no global performance benefit claimed;initial run fused remained slower than Java",
    "Existing worldgen-noise historical port provenance not newly certified",
    "Native monotonic process handles and global mutex are diagnostic only, not runtime capability/ownership integration",
    "32 warnings per fork; supplied stacks point to JDK/bootstrap paths, none name FusionProbe. Stackless warnings remain unclassified; this is not a warning-free JNI campaign or proof of absence of added warnings."
  ]
